        "solution_sketch": "After factoring ${a}$ out of the variable terms, complete the inner square using ${b}/(2({a}))$. The compensation is $({b})^2/(4({a}))$, giving k equal to $7-({b})^2/(4({a}))$. The positive leading coefficient makes this outside constant the minimum.",
